{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51438","headline":"方城怀古（句） · 马戴","name":"方城怀古（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"申胥枉向秦庭哭，靳尚终贻楚国羞。\n（《唐语林》二《文学》〖1〗○今按：《全唐诗》五五六缺题，又无出处。\n）（〖1〗此则出《金华子杂编》，见原本《说郛》卷十一，《四库全书》辑本《金华子杂编》失收。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}